# Keys a profile's xhttp-extra may set, merged into xhttpSettings.extra, xray 26.11.9 (SplitHTTPConfig).
# Not here: host, path and mode (set by the generator), downloadSettings (a second stream with its own address
# and sockopt), extra itself.
headers
headers.*
xPaddingBytes
xPaddingObfsMode
xPaddingKey
xPaddingHeader
xPaddingPlacement
xPaddingMethod
uplinkHTTPMethod
sessionIDPlacement
sessionIDKey
sessionIDTable
sessionIDLength
seqPlacement
seqKey
uplinkDataPlacement
uplinkDataKey
uplinkChunkSize
noGRPCHeader
noSSEHeader
scMaxEachPostBytes
scMinPostsIntervalMs
scMaxBufferedPosts
xmux
xmux.maxConcurrency
xmux.maxConnections
xmux.cMaxReuseTimes
xmux.hMaxRequestTimes
xmux.hMaxReusableSecs
xmux.hKeepAlivePeriod
